{"id":"int-cb5883163fcc61b6d2e96045bb5ef7b1","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-01T22:52:31.105084Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-9rc","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Added test/e2e/bookmarks.spec.ts covering the full create → list → edit → archive → delete lifecycle through the SvelteKit UI. Used a per-run unique URL for idempotency. Two prerequisite fixes: hooks.server.ts now skips CSRF in the e2e bypass mode (form CSRF tokens were never rendered); details/+page.svelte adds use:enhance to the toggleArchive/delete forms so they re-render instead of returning a raw JSON body. All 6 e2e specs pass; lint clean."}}
