{"id":"int-28205ba22b4cf583884a979cf452582a","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-01T23:06:47.59961Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-i7q","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Added test/e2e/search.spec.ts driving search box, tag chip selection, and Clear link. Two pre-existing search bugs surfaced by the spec and fixed: compileSearch default table alias was 'b' but the Drizzle query uses unaliased 'bookmarks' (caused 500); bookmarks.repo passed compiled SQL to sql.raw() which dropped the ? params (caused invalid SQL). All 7 e2e specs and 250 unit tests pass; lint clean."}}
