{"id":"int-8b48c7c017d8ba695ea00c5265c019c1","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-02T14:59:12.292521Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-tlj","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Added test/e2e/bulk.spec.ts that seeds 3 bookmarks, filters by a unique tag, checks 2 of 3, applies the archive bulk action, and verifies 2 are archived and 1 remains active. Adds use:enhance to the bulk form so a successful action re-renders the list instead of leaving a raw JSON response body, plus a flash banner showing the action result. All 8 e2e specs and 250 unit tests pass; lint clean."}}
