{"id":"int-e9bc74ea58528feb088129b72e1f02fc","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-02T18:48:35.880583Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-f4g","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Added test/e2e/import.spec.ts that uploads the Netscape fixture from /settings/import-export, asserts the success result reports 3 total entries with no failures (created + kept must sum to 3, so the spec is idempotent against the shared D1), and verifies the unique 'Svelte' bookmark is findable on /bookmarks with the #svelte tag in the cloud. All 10 e2e specs and 250 unit tests pass; lint clean."}}
