{"id":"int-d571f6a83c28ba0ec1a61db7482d0dbc","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-02T19:16:52.763478Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-llp","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Replaced the fragile error-message string match in the edit form action with an instanceof DuplicateUrlError check. Extracted the mapping into a small mapUpdateError helper so the response shape (409 + { error: 'duplicate_url' }) is unit-testable. Added test/unit/edit-duplicate-url.test.ts with 3 cases covering the duplicate path, unrelated Error messages, and non-Error values. The Svelte template branch was already correct. All 25 unit test files / 253 tests pass; lint clean."}}
