{"id":"int-12a1958e746669cde20388339351349b","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-02T20:47:29.259036Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-s23","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Switched createBookmark to Option B (upsert). Added CreateBookmarkOptions.upsert flag; buildUpsertPatch and shouldUpsertCreateRequest as pure helpers; moved mapUpdateError out of +page.server.ts (SvelteKit constraint) to src/lib/server/edit-bookmark.ts. POST /api/bookmarks/ now inspects the raw body and upserts when any field beyond url is present (empty tag_names counts as 'clear tags'). New /bookmarks/new form passes { upsert: true } to match Django behavior. New unit tests (10 cases) and a new e2e spec cover both paths. Documented everything in cloudflare/docs/API.md. All 26 unit files / 263 tests pass; all 13 e2e specs pass; lint clean; build clean."}}
