{"id":"int-ffaaf9ddfd1f78412731ce2e9c0e92db","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-06-02T22:23:04.436674Z","actor":"Pradeep Gowda","issue_id":"cloudpin-usj","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Added /public/assets/{id} route and hostname-based gating on the public share host. New pure modules: public-asset-access (403-vs-404 vs 409 decisions for the public surface) and hostname-routing (path allowlist + case-insensitive host matching). Hostname gate runs in hooks.server.ts before auth resolution so a public-host 404 never spends a D1 query. PUBLIC_HOSTNAME added to wrangler.jsonc (empty locally, share-preview.example.com in preview, share.example.com in production). 21 new unit tests across 2 files; 5 new e2e tests covering 200/403/404/403-after-toggle/403-after-unshare with cache-busting. docs/SHARING.md documents the topology, env var, access decision, and deployment. All 28 unit files / 283 tests pass; all 18 e2e specs pass; lint clean; build clean."}}
